      "id": "5faab810-5791-4068-b5a7-8f1595bebba9",
      "name": "Image",
      "description": {
        "content": "DEPRECATED: This type exists for historical compatibility and should not be used. Please use the [Artefact API](https://api-docs.humanitec.com/#tag/Artefact) instead.\n\nContainer Images (known simply as Images) can be registered with Humanitec. Continuous Integration (CI) pipelines can then notify Humanitec when a new build of a Container Image becomes available. Humanitec tracks the Image along with metadata about how it was built.\n<SchemaDefinition schemaRef=\"#/components/schemas/ImageRequest\" />\n",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
